==== sway-to-kdl golden: input <tmp>/config ====
bindsym button1 nop left
bindsym button2 nop middle
bindsym button3 nop right
bindsym button4 nop up
bindsym button5 nop down
mode test {
    bindsym button1 nop mode-left
}
